  "tier": "told-once",
  "plain": "In 1996, in the Brazilian town of Varginha, where a strange living being was reportedly captured, a wing of the local hospital is said to have been shut for weeks because the smell left by the creature was so strong. The documentary filmmaker and UFO investigator James Fox passes this on from what he was told, and has told it twice on the show. The first time he says only that \"they had to close that wing in the hospital for like weeks,\" and the second time he names the Hospital Regional and places the stench in the room where X-rays of the being were taken. If true, it would mean the being was physically handled and examined inside a real hospital."
